{%- comment -%}
  Zo Veilig — Winkelwagen. Visual 1:1 port of the design pack cart, wired to
  the live Shopify {{ cart }}: real line items, quantities (/cart/change),
  and checkout.

  "Vandaag te betalen" = the FULL live cart total (every line, minus cart-level
  discounts) — i.e. exactly what Shopify will actually charge at checkout, full
  stop. It is never reduced by excluding subscription line items: Shopify always
  charges the complete cart regardless of how a line is categorised in the
  theme, so a total that hid part of the cart would show a smaller number than
  the customer is actually charged (confirmed live 2026-09-09: a cart holding
  one Langer Thuis Zeker line + the activation-fee line charges the sum of
  both, not the activation fee alone).

  Subscription detection: a line is a subscription if its product's `type`
  equals section setting `sub_type` (default "Beveiligingsabonnement" — the
  real product_type shared by every live package across Langer Thuis, Mijn
  Thuis and Veilig Onderweg, confirmed from actual store data), OR if it
  carries the `sub_tag` tag (default "abonnement", kept for forward
  compatibility — no live product currently uses this tag; tags differ per
  line, e.g. Langer Thuis carries "Langer Thuis" + "keuzehulp", Mijn Thuis
  carries "Mijn Thuis" + "keuzehulp", so a tag alone can't identify a
  subscription across all lines the way `type` reliably does). This
  classification drives the "p/m" badge and the "Maandbedrag" line — it no
  longer subtracts anything from "Vandaag te betalen". Header/footer come
  from the theme layout.

  Package lines (2026-09-23 model, CLAUDE.md Pricing pipeline): a package sits in the cart as
  the real package product at quantity zv_promo_package_qty (the 3 prepaid months), with
  Shopify's automatic "Eerste 3 maanden" discount taking 50% off that line. Its "p/m" figure
  is the line's UNIT price before the discount (item.original_price) — the plain monthly
  rate, never unit x 3 — and its summary row is the line's real final_line_price, so the
  summary rows add up to "Vandaag te betalen". Package and installation lines have no +/−
  quantity controls: the package's quantity is the prepaid period, not something the
  customer picks, and zv-cart-guard resets any other quantity (package to 3, installation
  to 1) and reloads.

  Renders zv-cart-guard: keeps the package line at quantity 3, adds the Climax installation
  line to a Climax package that lacks it, and removes it from a cart without one; keeps each
  Woning line at 3 x its own platform's floors (NAMI and Climax each have their own), a bought
  package's floors on the platform's one-time Koop Woning line at quantity = floors, and keeps the
  camera subscription in step with a bought Videodeurbel (ADC-750). See
  snippets/zv-cart-guard.liquid.

  Koop lines (Huren/Kopen, 2026-10-24, docs/koop-checkout-2026-10-24.md): a bought package
  (Afname: Kopen on a Koop product, snippets/zv-koop-fk.liquid) shows its package name, "Kopen",
  its one-time final_line_price and no +/- (the guard keeps it at 1). It is never counted as a
  package for "p/m", the promo note or "Daarna". Woning on a bought package is its own one-time
  line since 2026-11-03 (the Koop Woning product, quantity = floors, no discount): one
  non-editable "Woning: <option value>" row in the Kopen group, labelled from the BOUGHT packages'
  Woning values (zv-woning-label with koop_variant_ids). Its id is read off the cart itself
  (zv-woning-koop-lines, woning_koop_variant_id_list), never looked up: the page is at the 20-handle limit.

  Groups and discount badge (2026-10-28, docs/cart-huur-koop-split-2026-10-28.md): the lines are
  listed in two groups, "Huren" above "Kopen · eenmalig", each with a subtotal of its
  lines' final_line_price; snippets/zv-cart-line-group.liquid decides a line's group (shared with Overzicht). A line
  with a line-level discount allocation shows original_line_price struck through, final_line_price
  and a badge with the discount's own title (snippets/zv-cart-line-price.liquid). Since 2026-10-29
  the "Overzicht" summary lists its rows in the same groups and order, each under the line's bare
  name (snippets/zv-cart-row-name.liquid, shared with Overzicht's cost card).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- include 'zv-pricing' -%}
{%- include 'zv-hidden-cart-lines' -%}
{%- assign sub_type = section.settings.sub_type | default: 'Beveiligingsabonnement' -%}
{%- assign sub_tag = section.settings.sub_tag | default: 'abonnement' -%}
{%- assign nami_install_geen_variant_id = all_products[zv_nami_install_geen_handle].selected_or_first_available_variant.id -%}
{%- assign nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id = all_products[zv_nami_install_telefonisch_handle].selected_or_first_available_variant.id -%}
{%- assign nami_install_huis_variant_id = all_products[zv_nami_install_huis_handle].selected_or_first_available_variant.id -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Videodeurbel/Afstandsbediening add-on lines (2026-09-26): resolved by handle only, never a
  hardcoded variant id or price — see CLAUDE.md. Each shows as a normal line (own name via
  zv_install_names_by_handle below, no +/- stepper since its quantity is fixed at the same
  qty-3/discount mechanic the package line uses, same as an installation line) — but, unlike
  the Woning line above, it keeps its remove link: it's a standalone product a customer might
  simply not want any more, not a per-package attribute.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Ontzorgpakket (Inzicht since 2026-10-13; one product per package since 2026-10-27: MOIOH,
  MOZOH, MOAOH, OHC012 for Beschermd/Protect): same treatment as the two add-ons above —
  resolved by handle only (zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list from zv-hidden-cart-lines), name via
  zv-install-name/zv_install_names_by_handle. A confirmed monthly service, so its unit price
  also counts toward "Daarna" below — see the true_month_cents addition further down. NOTE:
  the Huren hardware add-ons (huur-afstandsbediening H0010, huur-video-deurbel-750 H750, both
  productType "Huur Componenten", EUR/mnd) are monthly rentals too: they sync at PKG_QTY x units
  and count in "Daarna" since 2026-11-02 (price x quantity / zv_promo_package_qty, see the
  true_month_cents addition below). How Odoo bills them from month 4 is still open
  (unresolved.ODOO_ADDON_BILLING); not decided here.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Woning lines (2026-09-25; one per platform since 2026-10-27: one for the NAMI packages, one
  for the Climax packages): resolved by zv-hidden-cart-lines (woning_variant_ids /
  woning_variant_id_list, by handle and only if the first variant's SKU is the config's). Each
  renders as one non-editable row, "Woning: <option value>", from the Woning properties of ITS
  OWN package lines (zv-woning-label, never the product title). Its final_line_price counts in
  "Vandaag te betalen" like every line; "Daarna" keeps counting the surcharge from the property
  on the package lines (woning_applies_list: every package that offers Woning), never the line
  itself as well.
  Riders (2026-10-27): the camera subscription (zv_rider_variant_id_list) rides with a
  bought Videodeurbel: an add-on row without a remove link, since zv-cart-guard keeps it in step
  with the ADC-750 line (removing the doorbell removes it). Quantity pkg_qty, the prepaid months in
  the "Eerste 3 maanden" discount (since 2026-10-28; flat 1, one month, before), and in
  "Daarna" since 2026-11-02 like the Huren rentals (Odoo's own month-4 billing stays open:
  unresolved.ODOO_ADDON_BILLING).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign woning_applies_list = zv_woning_applies_handles | split: '|' -%}
{%- capture zv_rider_pairs -%}{%- render 'zv-addon-riders', map: zv_addon_rider_by_lead, lead_by: 'handle' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- render 'zv-cart-guard', activation_variant_id: activation_variant_id, sub_type: sub_type, nami_geen_variant_id: nami_install_geen_variant_id, nami_telefonisch_variant_id: nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id, nami_huis_variant_id: nami_install_huis_variant_id, pkg_qty: zv_promo_package_qty, inzicht_handle: zv_inzicht_handle, zeker_handle: zv_zeker_handle, beschermd_handle: zv_beschermd_handle, alert_handle: zv_alert_handle, protect_handle: zv_protect_handle, woning_variant_ids: woning_variant_ids, woning_applies_by_product: zv_woning_applies_by_product, woning_applies_fks_by_product: zv_woning_applies_fks_by_product, woning_v1: zv_woning_1_value, woning_v2: zv_woning_2_value, woning_legacy: zv_woning_legacy_prefix, woning_applies: zv_woning_applies_handles, woning_applies_fks: zv_woning_applies_fks, rider_pairs: zv_rider_pairs, koop_map: zv_koop_fk_by_handle, woning_koop_handles: zv_woning_koop_handles, woning_koop_skus: zv_woning_koop_skus -%}
{%- liquid
  assign zv_visible_item_count = 0
  for item in cart.items
    assign item_vid = item.variant_id | append: ''
    if zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list contains item_vid or woning_variant_id_list contains item_vid or woning_koop_variant_id_list contains item_vid or zv_rider_variant_id_list contains item_vid
      continue
    endif
    unless item.variant_id == zv_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id or item.variant_id == zv_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id or item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id or item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id
      assign zv_visible_item_count = zv_visible_item_count | plus: 1
    endunless
  endfor
-%}
{%- comment -%}
  NAMI installation choice (2026-11-02, docs/install-choice-to-cart-2026-11-02.md): the picker lives on
  this page and gates "Naar afrekenen". Detection mirrors sections/zv-checkout-overview.liquid
  (which keeps its own required radio group and cart_needs_activation gate as the fallback for a
  cart that reaches Overzicht without choosing here): a NAMI package is a rented line (sub_type /
  sub_tag plus a NAMI finder_key) or a Koop line (zv-koop-fk) of a NAMI package; the chosen option
  is whichever of the 3 install variants is in the cart. Climax needs no choice (CL003 is added
  by zv-cart-guard), so a Climax-only cart shows no picker and keeps an active button. Nothing here
  ever picks an option for the customer (zv-cart-guard must not either).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign has_nami_pkg = false
  assign has_nami_install_line = false
  assign selected_nami_install_id = nil
  for item in cart.items
    if nami_install_geen_variant_id != blank and item.variant_id == nami_install_geen_variant_id
      assign has_nami_install_line = true
      assign selected_nami_install_id = 'geen'
    endif
    if nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id != blank and item.variant_id == nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id
      assign has_nami_install_line = true
      assign selected_nami_install_id = 'telefonisch'
    endif
    if nami_install_huis_variant_id != blank and item.variant_id == nami_install_huis_variant_id
      assign has_nami_install_line = true
      assign selected_nami_install_id = 'huis'
    endif

    capture nami_koop_fk
      render 'zv-koop-fk', handle: item.product.handle, afname: item.properties['Afname'], map: zv_koop_fk_by_handle
    endcapture
    assign nami_koop_fk = nami_koop_fk | strip
    assign nami_pkg_fk = blank
    if nami_koop_fk == blank
      if item.product.type == sub_type or item.product.tags contains sub_tag
        assign nami_pkg_fk = item.product.metafields.custom.finder_key.value
      endif
    elsif nami_koop_fk != 'invalid'
      assign nami_pkg_fk = nami_koop_fk
    endif
    if nami_pkg_fk == 'aware' or nami_pkg_fk == 'aware_plus' or nami_pkg_fk == 'secure'
      assign has_nami_pkg = true
    endif
  endfor
  assign show_nami_install = has_nami_pkg
  assign cart_install_pending = false
  if show_nami_install and has_nami_install_line == false
    assign cart_install_pending = true
  endif
-%}
<div class="zv-cart">
  <section class="cartbar">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Winkelwagen</h1>
      <span class="cnt">{{ zv_visible_item_count }} {% if zv_visible_item_count == 1 %}artikel{% else %}artikelen{% endif %}</span>
      <a class="cont" href="{% render 'zv-route', key: 'oplossingen' %}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Verder winkelen</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cwrap">
    <div class="wrap">
      {%- if cart.item_count > 0 -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        Huren/Kopen groups (2026-10-28, docs/cart-huur-koop-split-2026-10-28.md): every line lands in
        exactly one of two groups, decided once here by snippets/zv-cart-line-group.liquid (the same
        decision Overzicht uses): the line's own billing cadence, never the flow that added it. Each
        group's subtotal is its lines' final_line_price, i.e. what Shopify charges today for them; the
        summary on the right reuses these keys, subtotals and sorted_items for its own rows.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign sorted_items = cart.items | sort: 'final_line_price' | reverse
        assign cg_huren_keys = '|'
        assign cg_kopen_keys = '|'
        assign cg_huren_cents = 0
        assign cg_kopen_cents = 0
        for item in sorted_items
          capture cg_group
            render 'zv-cart-line-group', item: item, sub_type: sub_type, sub_tag: sub_tag, woning_ids: woning_variant_id_list, ontzorg_ids: zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list, rider_ids: zv_rider_variant_id_list, addon_videodeurbel_id: zv_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id, addon_afstandsbediening_id: zv_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id
          endcapture
          assign cg_group = cg_group | strip
          if cg_group == 'huren'
            assign cg_huren_keys = cg_huren_keys | append: item.key | append: '|'
            assign cg_huren_cents = cg_huren_cents | plus: item.final_line_price
          else
            assign cg_kopen_keys = cg_kopen_keys | append: item.key | append: '|'
            assign cg_kopen_cents = cg_kopen_cents | plus: item.final_line_price
          endif
        endfor
        assign cg_groups = 'huren,kopen' | split: ','
      -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Layout 2026-11-03 (Robi): same structure as Overzicht. Left: "Kies uw installatie" first (NAMI
          only), then "Maandelijkse kosten" (Huren) and "Eenmalige kosten" (Kopen); right: "Wanneer
          betaalt u wat?" and the checkout button. Presentation only: the Huren/Kopen split, every live
          figure (today_cents, true_month_cents, cg_* subtotals), the install picker hooks and the
          checkout gate are unchanged; the totals loop below is the former summary loop, moved up so the
          left cards can use true_month_cents. A Huren row's monthly figure is original_line_price /
          zv_promo_package_qty (its quantity is pkg_qty x units/floors), the same figure
          zv-cart-line-price prints as "Loopt daarna door tegen …/mnd"; a line whose quantity isn't a
          multiple of pkg_qty falls back to zv-cart-line-price.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign today_cents = 0 -%}
        {%- assign true_month_cents = 0 -%}
        {%- assign cv_has_meldkamer = false -%}
        {%- for item in cart.items -%}
          {%- capture li_koop_fk -%}{%- render 'zv-koop-fk', handle: item.product.handle, afname: item.properties['Afname'], map: zv_koop_fk_by_handle -%}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- assign li_koop_fk = li_koop_fk | strip -%}
          {%- assign li_sub = false -%}
          {%- if item.product.type == sub_type or item.product.tags contains sub_tag -%}{%- assign li_sub = true -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if li_koop_fk != blank and li_koop_fk != 'invalid' -%}{%- assign li_sub = false -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if li_koop_fk == 'care' or li_koop_fk == 'guard' -%}{%- assign cv_has_meldkamer = true -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign today_cents = today_cents | plus: item.final_line_price -%}
          {%- assign item_vid = item.variant_id | append: '' -%}
          {%- if zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list contains item_vid -%}
            {%- assign true_month_cents = true_month_cents | plus: item.original_price -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if item.variant_id == zv_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id or item.variant_id == zv_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id -%}
            {%- assign addon_month_cents = item.original_price | times: item.quantity | divided_by: zv_promo_package_qty -%}
            {%- assign true_month_cents = true_month_cents | plus: addon_month_cents -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if zv_rider_variant_id_list contains item_vid -%}
            {%- assign true_month_cents = true_month_cents | plus: item.original_price -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if li_sub -%}
            {%- assign row_fk = item.product.metafields.custom.finder_key.value -%}
            {%- if row_fk == 'care' or row_fk == 'guard' -%}{%- assign cv_has_meldkamer = true -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- if row_fk == 'aware' or row_fk == 'aware_plus' or row_fk == 'care' or row_fk == 'secure' or row_fk == 'guard' -%}
              {%- assign li_wc = 0 -%}
              {%- if woning_applies_list contains item.product.handle -%}
                {%- capture li_wf -%}{%- render 'zv-woning-floors', value: item.properties['Woning'], v1: zv_woning_1_value, v2: zv_woning_2_value, legacy: zv_woning_legacy_prefix -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                {%- assign li_wc = li_wf | strip | plus: 0 | times: zv_woning_unit_cents -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- assign true_month_cents = true_month_cents | plus: item.original_price | plus: li_wc -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
        {%- assign cv_huren_orig_cents = 0 -%}
        {%- assign cv_huren_all_discounted = true -%}
        {%- for item in cart.items -%}
          {%- assign cv_key = '|' | append: item.key | append: '|' -%}
          {%- if cg_huren_keys contains cv_key -%}
            {%- assign cv_huren_orig_cents = cv_huren_orig_cents | plus: item.original_line_price -%}
            {%- if item.line_level_discount_allocations.size == 0 -%}{%- assign cv_huren_all_discounted = false -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
        {%- assign cv_discount_cents = cv_huren_orig_cents | minus: cg_huren_cents -%}
        {%- if cv_huren_all_discounted -%}{%- assign cv_promo_label = zv_label_commitment | capitalize -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign cv_promo_label = zv_label_commitment_no_discount | capitalize -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- if cart.cart_level_discount_applications.size > 0 -%}
          {%- for d in cart.cart_level_discount_applications -%}{%- assign today_cents = today_cents | minus: d.total_allocated_amount -%}{%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- assign cv_no = 0 -%}

        <form action="{{ routes.cart_url }}" method="post" id="cart-form" class="clayout">
          <div class="citems">
            {%- if show_nami_install -%}
              {%- assign cv_no = cv_no | plus: 1 -%}
              {%- capture cinstall_icon_geen -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M5.5 5.5l13 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}
              {%- capture cinstall_icon_telefonisch -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}
              {%- capture cinstall_icon_huis -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M5 10v9a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4v-6h4v6h4a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}
              {%- case selected_nami_install_id -%}
                {%- when 'geen' -%}{%- assign cinstall_sel_icon = cinstall_icon_geen -%}{%- assign cinstall_sel_label = zv_nami_install_geen_label -%}{%- assign cinstall_sel_cents = zv_nami_install_geen_cents -%}
                {%- when 'telefonisch' -%}{%- assign cinstall_sel_icon = cinstall_icon_telefonisch -%}{%- assign cinstall_sel_label = zv_nami_install_telefonisch_label -%}{%- assign cinstall_sel_cents = zv_nami_install_telefonisch_cents -%}
                {%- when 'huis' -%}{%- assign cinstall_sel_icon = cinstall_icon_huis -%}{%- assign cinstall_sel_label = zv_nami_install_huis_label -%}{%- assign cinstall_sel_cents = zv_nami_install_huis_cents -%}
              {%- endcase -%}
              <div class="cvcard cinstall-section{% if cart_install_pending %} cinstall-section--todo{% endif %}" id="cinstall" data-cart-install-section>
                <div class="cv-head">
                  <h2>{{ cv_no }}. {% if selected_nami_install_id != nil %}Uw installatie{% else %}Kies uw installatie{% endif %}</h2>
                  {%- if cart_install_pending -%}<span class="cv-todo">Nodig om af te rekenen</span>{%- endif -%}
                </div>
                {%- if selected_nami_install_id != nil -%}
                  <div class="cinstall-summary" data-cart-install-summary>
                    <span class="cinstall-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ cinstall_sel_icon }}</span>
                    <div>
                      <div class="ci-name">{{ cinstall_sel_label }}</div>
                      <div class="ci-actions">
                        <button type="button" class="cinstall-change" data-cart-install-change aria-controls="cinstall-options" aria-expanded="false">Wijzigen</button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ci-price">{{ cinstall_sel_cents | money }}</div>
                  </div>
                {%- endif -%}
                <div class="cinstall-options" id="cinstall-options" data-cart-install-options role="radiogroup" aria-label="Installatie"{% if selected_nami_install_id != nil %} hidden{% endif %}>
                  <label class="cinstall-opt">
                    <input type="radio" name="cart_install_option" required
                      data-install-variant-id="{{ nami_install_geen_variant_id }}"
                      data-install-cents="{{ zv_nami_install_geen_cents }}"
                      {%- if selected_nami_install_id == 'geen' %} checked{% endif %}>
                    <span class="cinstall-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ cinstall_icon_geen }}</span>
                    <span class="cinstall-title">{{ zv_nami_install_geen_label }}</span>
                    <span class="cinstall-desc">U installeert zelf</span>
                    <span class="cinstall-price">{{ zv_nami_install_geen_display }}</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="cinstall-opt">
                    <input type="radio" name="cart_install_option" required
                      data-install-variant-id="{{ nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id }}"
                      data-install-cents="{{ zv_nami_install_telefonisch_cents }}"
                      {%- if selected_nami_install_id == 'telefonisch' %} checked{% endif %}>
                    <span class="cinstall-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ cinstall_icon_telefonisch }}</span>
                    <span class="cinstall-title">{{ zv_nami_install_telefonisch_label }}</span>
                    <span class="cinstall-desc">Wij begeleiden u telefonisch</span>
                    <span class="cinstall-price">{{ zv_nami_install_telefonisch_display }}</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="cinstall-opt">
                    <input type="radio" name="cart_install_option" required
                      data-install-variant-id="{{ nami_install_huis_variant_id }}"
                      data-install-cents="{{ zv_nami_install_huis_cents }}"
                      {%- if selected_nami_install_id == 'huis' %} checked{% endif %}>
                    <span class="cinstall-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ cinstall_icon_huis }}</span>
                    <span class="cinstall-title">{{ zv_nami_install_huis_label }}</span>
                    <span class="cinstall-desc">Onze monteur installeert alles</span>
                    <span class="cinstall-price">{{ zv_nami_install_huis_display }}</span>
                  </label>
                  {%- if selected_nami_install_id != nil -%}
                    <button type="button" class="cinstall-cancel" data-cart-install-cancel>Annuleren</button>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>
                <div class="cinstall-err" data-cart-install-err hidden>Er ging iets mis bij het opslaan van uw keuze. Probeer het opnieuw.</div>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- for cg in cg_groups -%}
              {%- if cg == 'huren' -%}
                {%- assign cg_keys = cg_huren_keys -%}{%- assign cg_cents = cg_huren_cents -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- assign cg_keys = cg_kopen_keys -%}{%- assign cg_cents = cg_kopen_cents -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if cg_keys == '|' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                            {%- assign cv_rows = 0 -%}
              {%- for item in sorted_items -%}
                {%- assign cg_key = '|' | append: item.key | append: '|' -%}
                {%- unless cg_keys contains cg_key -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
                {%- assign cv_rows = cv_rows | plus: 1 -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
              {%- if cv_rows == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
              {%- assign cv_no = cv_no | plus: 1 -%}
              <div class="cvcard cgroup cgroup--{{ cg }}">
                <div class="cv-head">
                  {%- if cg == 'huren' -%}
                    <h2>{{ cv_no }}. Maandelijkse kosten</h2>
                    <span class="cv-badge">{{ cv_promo_label }}</span>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <h2>{{ cv_no }}. Eenmalige kosten</h2>
                    <span class="cv-hint">U betaalt dit één keer, vandaag</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>
                {%- for item in sorted_items -%}
                  {%- assign cg_key = '|' | append: item.key | append: '|' -%}
                  {%- unless cg_keys contains cg_key -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
                  {%- assign item_vid = item.variant_id | append: '' -%}
                  {%- assign is_install = false -%}
                  {%- if item.variant_id == activation_variant_id or item.variant_id == nami_install_geen_variant_id or item.variant_id == nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id or item.variant_id == nami_install_huis_variant_id -%}{%- assign is_install = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign cv_monthly_ok = false -%}
                  {%- if cg == 'huren' and zv_promo_package_qty > 0 -%}
                    {%- assign cv_mod = item.quantity | modulo: zv_promo_package_qty -%}
                    {%- if cv_mod == 0 -%}
                      {%- assign cv_monthly_ok = true -%}
                      {%- assign cv_monthly_cents = item.original_line_price | divided_by: zv_promo_package_qty -%}
                      {%- assign cv_units = item.quantity | divided_by: zv_promo_package_qty -%}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if woning_variant_id_list contains item_vid or woning_koop_variant_id_list contains item_vid -%}
                    {%- comment -%} A Woning line: not editable here (no quantity, no remove, no product link); zv-cart-guard keeps its quantity in step with its packages. {%- endcomment -%}
                    {%- capture woning_label -%}{%- render 'zv-woning-label', variant_id: item_vid, variant_ids: woning_variant_ids, applies_by_product: zv_woning_applies_by_product, v1: zv_woning_1_value, v2: zv_woning_2_value, legacy: zv_woning_legacy_prefix, koop_variant_ids: woning_koop_variant_ids, applies_fks_by_product: zv_woning_applies_fks_by_product, koop_map: zv_koop_fk_by_handle -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                    {%- assign woning_label = woning_label | strip -%}
                    <div class="citem citem--woning">
                      <div class="ci-thumb">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M5 10v9a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4v-6h4v6h4a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                      </div>
                      <div>
                        <div class="ci-name">Woning{% if woning_label != '' %}: {{ woning_label | escape }}{% endif %}</div>
                        <div class="ci-meta">Uitbreiding van uw pakket</div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="ci-right">
                        {%- if cv_monthly_ok -%}
                          <div class="ci-price">{{ cv_monthly_cents | money }} <span>p/m</span></div>
                        {%- else -%}
                          {%- render 'zv-cart-line-price', item: item, woning: true, pkg_qty: zv_promo_package_qty -%}
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    {%- continue -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- capture ci_koop_fk -%}{%- render 'zv-koop-fk', handle: item.product.handle, afname: item.properties['Afname'], map: zv_koop_fk_by_handle -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                  {%- assign ci_koop_fk = ci_koop_fk | strip -%}
                  {%- assign is_koop = false -%}
                  {%- if ci_koop_fk != blank and ci_koop_fk != 'invalid' -%}{%- assign is_koop = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign is_sub = false -%}
                  {%- if item.product.type == sub_type or item.product.tags contains sub_tag -%}{%- assign is_sub = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- if is_koop -%}{%- assign is_sub = false -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign item_name = item.product.title -%}
                  {%- if is_sub -%}
                    {%- capture cfg_name -%}{%- render 'zv-package-name', finder_key: item.product.metafields.custom.finder_key.value, names: zv_package_names_by_fk -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                  {%- elsif is_koop -%}
                    {%- capture cfg_name -%}{%- render 'zv-package-name', finder_key: ci_koop_fk, names: zv_package_names_by_fk -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                  {%- elsif item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id -%}
                    {%- assign cfg_name = 'Videodeurbel (kopen)' -%}
                  {%- elsif item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id -%}
                    {%- assign cfg_name = 'Afstandsbediening (kopen)' -%}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- capture cfg_name -%}{%- render 'zv-install-name', handle: item.product.handle, names: zv_install_names_by_handle -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign cfg_name = cfg_name | strip -%}
                  {%- if cfg_name != blank -%}{%- assign item_name = cfg_name -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign is_rider = false -%}{%- if zv_rider_variant_id_list contains item_vid -%}{%- assign is_rider = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign is_addon = is_rider -%}
                  {%- if item.variant_id == zv_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id or item.variant_id == zv_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id or zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list contains item_vid or item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id or item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id -%}{%- assign is_addon = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign cv_fk = item.product.metafields.custom.finder_key.value -%}
                  {%- if is_koop -%}{%- assign cv_fk = ci_koop_fk -%}{%- endif -%}
                  <div class="citem">
                    <div class="ci-thumb">
                      {%- if item.image -%}
                        <img src="{{ item.image | image_url: width: 176 }}" alt="{{ item_name | escape }}" width="88" height="88" loading="lazy">
                      {%- else -%}
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8l9-4 9 4-9 4-9-4z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M3 8v8l9 4 9-4V8M12 12v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <div class="ci-name">{% if is_install %}{{ item_name | escape }}{% else %}<a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item_name | escape }}</a>{% endif %}</div>
                      {%- unless item.variant.title contains 'Default' -%}<div class="ci-meta">{{ item.variant.title | escape }}</div>{%- endunless -%}
                      {%- if is_sub or is_koop -%}
                        {%- if cv_fk == 'aware' or cv_fk == 'aware_plus' or cv_fk == 'secure' -%}<div class="ci-meta">Gebruik van de beveiligde app en ontvang meldingen</div>
                        {%- elsif cv_fk == 'care' or cv_fk == 'guard' -%}<div class="ci-meta">24/7 meldkameropvolging, gebruik van de beveiligde app en ontvang meldingen</div>{%- endif -%}
                        {%- if is_koop -%}<div class="ci-meta">Apparatuur, wordt uw eigendom</div>{%- endif -%}
                      {%- elsif zv_koop_maandelijks_variant_id_list contains item_vid -%}<div class="ci-meta">Maandelijkse dienst voor app en meldingen</div>
                      {%- elsif is_rider -%}<div class="ci-meta">Opslag en live beelden bekijken</div>
                      {%- elsif zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list contains item_vid -%}<div class="ci-meta">Onderhoud en vervanging bij defect</div>
                      {%- elsif item.variant_id == zv_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id or item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id -%}<div class="ci-meta">Makkelijk het alarmsysteem aan- en uitzetten</div>
                      {%- elsif item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id -%}<div class="ci-meta">Wordt uw eigendom</div>
                      {%- elsif is_install and show_nami_install and item.variant_id != activation_variant_id -%}<div class="ci-meta">Gekozen bij stap 1</div>
                      {%- elsif is_install -%}<div class="ci-meta">Onze monteur installeert alles</div>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      {%- if cg == 'huren' and cv_monthly_ok and cv_units > 1 -%}<div class="ci-meta">Aantal: {{ cv_units }}</div>{%- elsif cg == 'kopen' and item.quantity > 1 and is_koop == false -%}<div class="ci-meta">Aantal: {{ item.quantity }}</div>{%- endif -%}
                      {%- if item.selling_plan_allocation -%}<div class="ci-meta">{{ item.selling_plan_allocation.selling_plan.name | escape }}</div>{%- endif -%}
                      <div class="ci-actions">
                        {%- unless is_sub or is_install or is_addon or is_koop -%}
                        <div class="qty">
                          <a href="{{ routes.cart_change_url }}?id={{ item.key }}&quantity={{ item.quantity | minus: 1 }}" aria-label="Aantal verlagen" class="qbtn">−</a>
                          <span>{{ item.quantity }}</span>
                          <a href="{{ routes.cart_change_url }}?id={{ item.key }}&quantity={{ item.quantity | plus: 1 }}" aria-label="Aantal verhogen" class="qbtn">+</a>
                        </div>
                        {%- endunless -%}
                        {%- unless is_rider or is_install -%}
                        <a class="ci-remove" href="{{ routes.cart_change_url }}?id={{ item.key }}&quantity=0"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16M9 7V5h6v2M6 7l1 13h10l1-13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Verwijderen</a>
                        {%- endunless -%}
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ci-right">
                      {%- if cv_monthly_ok -%}
                        <div class="ci-price">{{ cv_monthly_cents | money }} <span>p/m</span></div>
                      {%- else -%}
                        {%- render 'zv-cart-line-price', item: item -%}
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                {%- endfor -%}
                <div class="cvtot">
                  {%- if cg == 'huren' -%}
                    {%- if true_month_cents > 0 -%}<div class="cvtot-main"><span>Normaal maandbedrag</span><b>{{ true_month_cents | money }} <small>p/m</small></b></div>{%- endif -%}
                    {%- if cv_discount_cents > 0 -%}
                      <div class="cvtot-calc">
                        <div><span>Eerste {{ zv_promo_months }} maanden zonder korting</span><span>{{ cv_huren_orig_cents | money }}</span></div>
                        <div class="cvtot-disc"><span>Uw korting</span><span>− {{ cv_discount_cents | money }}</span></div>
                      </div>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    <div class="cvtot-promo"><span>Eerste {{ zv_promo_months }} maanden, vandaag vooruit</span><b>{{ cg_cents | money }}</b></div>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <div class="cvtot-main"><span>Totaal eenmalig</span><b>{{ cg_cents | money }}</b></div>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>

          <aside class="csummary">
            <div class="ccost ccost--dark">
              <h2>Wanneer betaalt u wat?</h2>
              <ol class="cvtl">
                <li class="cvtl-step cvtl-step--today">
                  <span class="cvtl-label">Vandaag te betalen</span>
                  <span class="cvtl-amt">{{ today_cents | money }}</span>
                  {%- if cv_discount_cents > 0 -%}<span class="cvtl-save">U bespaart {{ cv_discount_cents | money }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                  {%- if cg_huren_keys != '|' and cg_kopen_keys != '|' and cart.cart_level_discount_applications.size == 0 -%}
                    <dl class="cvtl-parts">
                      <div><dt>Eerste {{ zv_promo_months }} maanden vooruit</dt><dd>{{ cg_huren_cents | money }}</dd></div>
                      <div><dt>Eenmalige kosten</dt><dd>{{ cg_kopen_cents | money }}</dd></div>
                    </dl>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if cart.cart_level_discount_applications.size > 0 -%}
                    {%- for d in cart.cart_level_discount_applications -%}<span class="cvtl-sub">Inclusief korting {{ d.title | escape }}: −{{ d.total_allocated_amount | money }}</span>{%- endfor -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </li>
                {%- if true_month_cents > 0 -%}
                  <li class="cvtl-step cvtl-step--prepaid">
                    <span class="cvtl-label">Maand 1 t/m {{ zv_promo_months }}</span>
                    <span class="cvtl-amt cvtl-amt--sm">{{ 0 | money }} <small>— al vooruitbetaald</small></span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="cvtl-step cvtl-step--monthly">
                    <span class="cvtl-label">Vanaf maand {{ zv_promo_months | plus: 1 }}</span>
                    <span class="cvtl-amt cvtl-amt--md">{{ true_month_cents | money }} <small>per maand</small></span>
                    <span class="cvtl-sub">Automatisch via SEPA-incasso</span>
                  </li>
                {%- endif -%}
              </ol>
              <p class="s-sub">Alle bedragen zijn inclusief btw.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="cactions">
            {%- if cart_install_pending -%}
              {%- comment -%} The real gate, not just styling: a disabled button has no href to follow. The picker reloads the page after saving, so this always reflects the live cart. {%- endcomment -%}
              <p class="cinstall-hint" id="cinstall-hint" role="status">Kies eerst <a href="#cinstall">uw installatie</a> bovenaan de pagina.</p>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--gold cta-checkout" disabled aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="cinstall-hint">Naar afrekenen <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
            {%- else -%}
              <a href="{{ routes.cart_url }}?view=overzicht" class="btn btn--gold cta-checkout">Naar afrekenen <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
            {%- endif -%}
            <div class="c-guarantee">
              {%- if cv_has_meldkamer -%}<div><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h3l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L14 14l5 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A15 15 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></i>Nederlandse meldkamer, 24/7 bewaakt</div>{%- endif -%}
              <div><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12l5 5 11-11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></i>14 dagen bedenktijd (herroepingsrecht)</div>
              <div><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="10" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></i>Veilig betalen via iDEAL &amp; SEPA</div>
            </div>
            <div class="pay-row"><span>Betaalmethoden</span><span class="pay-chip">iDEAL</span><span class="pay-chip">SEPA</span><span class="pay-chip">Creditcard</span></div>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </form>
        {%- if show_nami_install -%}
        <script>
          (function () {
            // NAMI installation choice: swap the cart's install-fee line to match the selected
            // radio, then reload so the server-rendered button state, totals and Overzicht all
            // reflect the real live cart (same reload-after-fix pattern as zv-cart-guard).
            // Same swap as the fallback radio group on Overzicht.
            var options = document.querySelector('#cart-form [data-cart-install-options]');
            var err = document.querySelector('#cart-form [data-cart-install-err]');
            if (!options) return;
            var radios = Array.prototype.slice.call(options.querySelectorAll('input[type="radio"]'));
            var FEE_VARIANT_IDS = [
              {{ activation_variant_id | json }},
              {{ nami_install_geen_variant_id | json }},
              {{ nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id | json }},
              {{ nami_install_huis_variant_id | json }}
            ].filter(function (id) { return id != null; }).map(String);

            // Collapsed state (a choice is already made): "Wijzigen" swaps the summary row for the
            // full radio list (the chosen radio is still checked), "Annuleren" swaps it back.
            var summary = document.querySelector('#cart-form [data-cart-install-summary]');
            var changeBtn = document.querySelector('#cart-form [data-cart-install-change]');
            var cancelBtn = document.querySelector('#cart-form [data-cart-install-cancel]');
            function setExpanded(open) {
              if (summary) summary.hidden = open;
              options.hidden = !open;
              if (changeBtn) changeBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
              var target = open ? (options.querySelector('input[type="radio"]:checked') || radios[0]) : changeBtn;
              if (target) target.focus();
            }
            if (changeBtn) changeBtn.addEventListener('click', function () { setExpanded(true); });
            if (cancelBtn) cancelBtn.addEventListener('click', function () { setExpanded(false); });

            radios.forEach(function (radio) {
              radio.addEventListener('change', function () {
                if (!radio.checked) return;
                var targetId = radio.getAttribute('data-install-variant-id');
                if (!targetId) return;
                radios.forEach(function (r) { r.disabled = true; });
                if (err) err.hidden = true;

                // Remove every other fee-type line first (swap, not stack): the 2 other NAMI
                // options and a stray activation-fee line, in one request.
                var updates = {};
                FEE_VARIANT_IDS.forEach(function (id) {
                  if (id !== String(targetId)) updates[id] = 0;
                });

                window.fetch('/cart/update.js', {
                  method: 'POST',
                  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
                  body: JSON.stringify({ updates: updates })
                })
                  .then(function (res) {
                    if (!res.ok) throw new Error(res.status);
                    return window.fetch('/cart/add.js', {
                      method: 'POST',
                      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
                      body: JSON.stringify({ items: [{ id: targetId, quantity: 1 }] })
                    });
                  })
                  .then(function (res) {
                    if (!res.ok) throw new Error(res.status);
                    window.location.reload();
                  })
                  .catch(function () {
                    radios.forEach(function (r) { r.disabled = false; });
                    if (err) err.hidden = false;
                  });
              });
            });
          })();
        </script>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="cempty">
          <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 4h3l2.2 12.2a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h7.1a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.55L22 8H6.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="10" cy="21" r="1.6" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="19" cy="21" r="1.6" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div>
          <h2>Uw winkelwagen is leeg</h2>
          <p>Nog niets gekozen? Doe de Keuzehulp, dan vinden we samen de oplossing die bij uw situatie past.</p>
          <div class="ce-cta"><a class="btn btn--gold" href="{% render 'zv-route', key: 'keuzehulp' %}">Keuzehulp <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{% render 'zv-route', key: 'oplossingen' %}">Bekijk oplossingen</a></div>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
.zv-cart {
  --ink:#1a1230; --indigo:#322469; --indigo-soft:#ece8fb; --paper:#fffdf8; --cream:#fdfaf2;
  --gold:#e4a311; --gold-lt:#f5c84a; --belt:#9c6c08; --line:#e7e0cf; --line-2:#ddd4c0;
  --muted:#6f6786; --muted-2:#8c84a6; --rood:#e24b4a;
  color:var(--ink); line-height:1.5; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbf5e9,#f4ecda);
}
.zv-cart .wrap { max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 clamp(20px,3.6vw,52px); }
.zv-cart .cartbar { background:var(--paper); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
.zv-cart .cartbar .wrap { display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:14px; padding:22px 0; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.zv-cart .cartbar h1 { font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px); font-weight:900; color:var(--indigo); letter-spacing:-.02em; }
